<title>USA: Leslie's Poolmart Inc Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Leslie's Poolmart Inc Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended     Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			  Sep 28,     Sep 30,    Sep 28,    Sep 30,</p>
<p>			    1996	   1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p>Sales-Retail Stores $59,984     $53,233   $159,881   $133,712</p>
<p>Sales-Mail Order	2,283	 2,346	6,804	7,013</p>
<p>Sales-Other	     1,390	 1,283	3,871	3,442</p>
<p>	 Total Sales   63,657	56,862    170,556    144,167</p>
<p> Gross Profit	  25,868	22,230     68,362     55,939</p>
<p> SG&amp;A expenses	 18,092	15,195     51,804     43,568</p>
<p>Amortization of</p>
<p> Acquisition Costs	 64	    61	  191	  180</p>
<p> Operating Income     7,712	 6,974     16,367     12,191</p>
<p> Interest Expense	 574	   620	2,164	1,946</p>
<p> Income Before Taxes  7,138	 6,354     14,203     10,245</p>
<p> Income Tax Provision 2,962	 1,537	5,894	3,152</p>
<p> Net Income	     4,176	 4,817	8,309	7,093</p>
<p> Income Per share	0.62	  0.73	 1.22	 1.07</p>
<p>Weighted Avg shares</p>
<p>   outstanding	  6,776	 6,618	6,806	6,611</p>
<p>(In thousands, except per-share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: Tax rate in Q3 1996 was 41.5 percent versus 24.2 percent rate in 1995. 1995 quarter included tax reserve reversal benefit.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
